      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This simple game is about catching and eating rice balls with one of two characters - Porun-chan or Shian-chan. This was the first game made from scratch from MOOK-TV. Multiple digital version of the game are available and it was released on Famicom cartridge in limited quantities."
